          },
          "content": [
           {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "•use w/ MAOIs"
           }
          ]
         },
         {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "attrs": {
           "indLeft": 0,
           "indRight": 0,
           "indFirst": 0,
           "spaceBefore": 0,
           "spaceAfter": 0,
           "line": null,
           "align": "left",
           "shade": null,
           "borders": null,
           "marker": null
          },
          "content": [
           {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "•avoid in pts w/ known cardiac abnormalities due to increased risk of sudden death – specifically, some agents are CI in pts w/ HF, recent MI, arrhythmia, or mod-severe HTN "
           }
          ]
         },
         {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "attrs": {
           "indLeft": 0,
           "indRight": 0,
           "indFirst": 0,
           "spaceBefore": 0,
           "spaceAfter": 0,
